your main inventory at all times - and make sure they don't
dilute/burn/freeze. Otherwise you're stuck with a cursed 2h weapon,
unable to use your bags or apply items or cast spells, etc. There are
some other ways you can uncurse the 2h weapon (magic trap, pray in
vlad's tower if you can, etc) - you can search r.g.r.n. for the full
details.

Just so i don't have to deal with the extra worries that come along
with using a 2h weapon in gehennom and below, i always just use a 1h
weapon and a shield. The additional 6 or so AC (+5 small shield) is
just a bonus.



